# Face Grouping Application Overview

This application processes images to detect and group similar faces using the InsightFace library. The main functionality is implemented in [face_grouping_v5.py](mdc:face_grouping_v5.py).

## Key Features
- Face detection and embedding generation using InsightFace
- Support for multiple image formats including HEIC/HEIF
- Face grouping based on cosine similarity
- State tracking to resume processing
- Face cropping and organization into groups

## Main Components
1. Image Processing
   - Supports multiple image formats (JPG, PNG, HEIC, etc.)
   - Uses OpenCV for image handling
   - Converts HEIC/HEIF to BGR format

2. Face Analysis
   - Uses InsightFace's FaceAnalysis model
   - Generates face embeddings for similarity comparison
   - Detects face bounding boxes for cropping

3. Grouping Logic
   - Groups faces based on cosine similarity threshold
   - Maintains running average of face embeddings
   - Organizes cropped faces into group directories

4. State Management
   - Tracks processed files and their modifications
   - Saves processing state to resume later
   - Handles file changes and updates

